    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec91f718fb0fb59ed1356fde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼呜～这次真可惜呢～\n是不是因为距离稍嫌有点短呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc8ff6733977ab2570b052887a3718f5aaa97acb9e199d34c38761017670ec5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
