    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a96d1b924646d09208b83a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，只要距离再长一点～\n并继续接受训练员大人的锻炼，一定有机会～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85253d2c9a683be703054d57d05b3b66f3894a5fea1c4c29b127cf98ee305cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b91ed06555156eae8dbb101d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼前的光景令人难以置信。\n采珠已是一线级选手，\n目白光明竟然有办法如此逼近她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b9d78b0215bfb5852b04d636e7ce20abdf74f42f6e940e927f657f8e1740e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6cc17efdfd9901e0d8e4310",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光明，你该不会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cd95467129c7dd07b4277d21a2038f5193d194b4d6d057000c81a5d04948bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3f5648252ff74ee8b37067",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在心中推测着究竟发生了什么事。\n最后想到的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "363991305e790a99e2d3ca6f67e43ef1238e38580450590bbe252b211693401f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8acab144dce7995cacd543",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
