    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08062f5370940a73f8e7cd50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的～我想应该差不多可以\n不用继续担心了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9ee8f8e2989b5d36e7e2b1778c18fd7f115b219d51a840569d0e13cadbd4d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c691728a2240333c8a376126",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们到了保健室检查目白光明的脚，\n果然在小腿处发现了\n隐隐约约的成长纹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fc7a39eeaf7c337fb3a3f45f3f7a8ef8b73a613dcf318f7106d794e53cd709b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1863dc9fccfe8146c92f55be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cce4d859896c50ae77983029951d94a41ba9369dc531a5184d37f6b802e9b98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
