    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a95a520cf547630a928c5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道我们的方针真的出错了吗？\n是否别突然就挑战GⅠ这个大目标，\n循序渐进地往上挑战比较好？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e77f501957091048f744b8a23ebe9e456901c72dd4a01e27c62cc797b788ca4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
