    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aa0293539a3db83e3330b0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说这是新马级常见的症状。\n目白家的主治医生也说了，\n“只能慢慢等待”～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb6a5187269c2aec9fe4cd512d1ebdbd41121cd4a18b8414bd95f841d278237",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c244b6f1b913882f3f44d9a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明总是坚持自己的步调。\n不过，她的我行我素其实事出有因……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b43de91f06a875a2ad3d9c94a59fa7dbd02d43639b2073c45e23f410405d74e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7927f54df85a2b8c86f7f7eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抱歉，我都没发现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "826d249489c6ddd3376d94fa945a8bb47143ab73ff63916aea052c76d6d6d321",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac42bd36e4d9363b7ad4b385",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中都有合理的理由。\n这次也一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c13ff2b821c5aa337fe16e7a20a5325b69d187d55d0aeea2dcc01bcac82d357",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
