    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d54b6ceb13ff88fcb757b62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别这么说，训练员大人。\n该道歉的是我～\n我擅自隐瞒这件事，真是个坏孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8877ac381b759d7b626f260549f699596b9383724e0abb24c4639def735caafe",
